    "detailed_description": "You have become part of a recruitment program for some shady company.<br>The plan was to enter an underwater ruin, explore it, and give a large prize to anyone who escaped.<br>Be sure to remember the instructions given by the company.<br><br><strong>If you find any anomalies, descend.<br><br>If there are no anomalies, ascend.</strong><br><br>If you reach sea level, you have escaped safely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>This is a walking simulator genre game inspired by The Exit 8.<br>Explore underwater ruins to discover anomalies and decide whether to ascend or descend.<br>Some anomalies may attack you.<br><br>The game supports two difficulty levels: Classic (Easy) mode and Normal mode.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Classic mode: This is a basic mode where you have to find anomalies and escape. The difficulty level is low and you start out in classic mode.<br></li><li> Normal mode: This mode increases the level of difficulty by adding oxygen management and photo taking functions. Unlocked upon clearing Classic Mode.</li></ul>The average play time of the game is expected to be around 1 to 2 hours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2>WASD: Move<br>Left Shift: Thruster<br>Spacebar: Ascend<br>Left Ctrl: Descend<br>Left mouse button: Headlight<br>Right mouse button: Take photo<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2>Anyone, regardless of whether they are an individual or a corporation, can broadcast without permission.<br>There are no sounds that could be a copyright issue.<br>We would appreciate it if you could write down the title of the game and a link to the Steam store.",
